ciones del operador ni superioridad en campo.","receipt_ref":"/datos/workspaces/personal/specorganon-validation/method-superiority-v1/native-reliability-02/attempt-02/transport/host-journal/role-02-frame-review/receipt.json","source_files_sha256":"44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a","source_fingerprint":"f852cbd43363308a811b0b11d39e32e18b8748f27a068cd99bb2363fb08e759b","source_phase_snapshot":"84dfa4e5b54483a362766ee390e586f76f2746f967ac3a1548af963a4cd96653","usage_reported":{"cache_read_tokens":0,"input_tokens":19452,"output_tokens":1290,"thinking_tokens":1182,"total_tokens":20742},"verdict":"accept"},{"action":"author","actor":"agent:codex-isolated-author","author_format":"items-v1","cost":null,"derived_manifest_ref":"/datos/workspaces/personal/specorganon-validation/method-superiority-v1/native-reliability-02/attempt-02/controller/role-artifacts/role-03-critique-author-manifest.json","derived_manifest_sha256":"0829a4da60bb0d323c98c51c8b5fda6a7b72e8c9fafc063dcc4481cb9e5105cb","findings":[],"job_id":"role-03-critique-author","phase":"critique","raw_packet_ref":"/datos/workspaces/personal/specorganon-validation/method-superiority-v1/native-reliability-02/attempt-02/controller/role-artifacts/role-03-critique-author-packet.json","raw_packet_sha256":"98e82ed6835fd0925c6672c27f7611df5a2bc545dc15b1372cdc68ac7d5347ad","reason":"Se aportan los cinco artefactos faltantes de critique a partir del contrato y mandato suministrados, con alternativas y fundamentos explícitos, sin atribuir ejecuciones ni elecciones al operador.","receipt_ref":"/datos/workspaces/personal/specorganon-validation/method-superiority-v1/native-reliability-02/attempt-02/transport/host-journal/role-03-critique-author/receipt.json","source_files_sha256":"44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a","source_fingerprint":"14712438e443cb2a9333a639e8e538e13520ddc9e687c59fd8483e56cc8c27e6","source_phase_snapshot":"c5b3aae846c3df469dd246bdfb3090b8f07277bdc01c3f2c439e58574f04c8a2","usage_reported":{"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"cached_input_tokens":5120,"input_tokens":13547,"output_tokens":944,"reasoning_output_tokens":85}},{"action":"approval","actor":"reviewer:gemini-isolated-review","cost":null,"findings":[],"job_id":"role-04-critique-approval","phase":"critique","reason":"El artefacto lf_norm se ajusta plenamente a las directrices de existing-mandate.md y al encargo técnico de contract.md. Resuelve de forma rigurosa y justificada el conflicto normativo entre integridad atómica del lote y disponibilidad parcial a favor de lf_frame_atomic, respetando la obligación contractual de no emitir salidas ante peticiones inválidas. Mantiene una clara separación entre juicios de valor y afirmaciones fácticas, no atribuye elecciones indebidas al operador ni reclama beneficios de campo o ejecuciones de pruebas no realizadas.","receipt_ref":"/datos/workspaces/personal/specorganon-validation/method-superiority-v1/native-reliability-02/attempt-02/transport/host-journal/role-04-critique-approval/receipt.json","source_files_sha256":"44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a","source_fingerprint":"211d3990c20639e1bace68d75eeb4783a3493c396d20bcb814a283a5d8be6941","source_phase_snapshot":"2b3c4fb2b4e442d0f95843ace92a1c7696714d3463fe56c64b95024a356e6fdc","usage_reported":{"cache_read_tokens":0,"input_tokens":22184,"output_tokens":920,"thinking_tokens":763,"total_tokens":23104},"verdict":"accept"},{"action":"review","actor":"reviewer:gemini-isolated-review","cost":null,"findings":[],"job_id":"role-05-critique-review","phase":"critique","reason":"La fase critique cumple rigurosamente con los requisitos del contrato de fase y el mandato: se han definido el concepto clave (lf_concept), el supuesto de partida (lf_assumption), dos opciones de marco rivales sustantivas (lf_frame_atomic y lf_frame_salvage) y la norma técnica rectora (lf_norm). Los juicios de valor se mantienen estrictamente separados de las afirmaciones fácticas, fundamentando adecuadamente la priorización de la integridad atómica contractual sobre la disponibilidad parcial conforme a contract.md. Las dependencias y versiones son consistentes, no se introducen definiciones circulares ni reclamos indebidos de beneficios de campo o pruebas no ejecutadas, y la opción normativa cuenta con la aprobación requerida respetando los límites de recursos de la fase.","receipt_ref":"/datos/workspaces/personal/specorganon-validation/method-superiority-v1/native-reliability-02/attempt-02/transport/host-journal/role-05-critique-review/receipt.json","source_files_sha256":"44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a","source_fingerprint":"b66f81ff1ecab0492396f96f7db3409736f7734ce33745f5b5bc2f2e05ed0c68","source_phase_snapshot":"ce980bfaffbd1543ec2f483bfb9a58a4970681f9f50f9905e0429acc1cea35fc","usage_reported":{"cache_read_tokens":0,"input_tokens":22138,"output_tokens":915,"thinking_tokens":727,"total_tokens":23053},"verdict":"accept"},{"action":"author","actor":"agent:codex-isolated-author","author_format":"items-v1","cost":null,"derived_manifest_ref":"/datos/workspaces/personal/specorganon-validation/method-superiority-v1/native-reliability-02/attempt-02/controller/role-artifacts/role-06-study-author-manifest.json","derived_manifest_sha256":"a899bc0eae69d259f54fbc64a8549b49aa50b473d7ed68248805f2678acb0748","findings":[],"job_id":"role-06-study-author","phase":"study","raw_packet_ref":"/datos/workspaces/personal/specorganon-validation/method-superiority-v1/native-reliability-02/attempt-02/controller/role-artifacts/role-06-study-author-packet.json","raw_packet_sha256":"ac772084c57c6d6009c336555e89fbd02a5e09225b2351c3cced998489b668e6","reason":"Se proponen los artefactos de study y su fundamento documental, distinguiendo prespecificación de medición. No se aportan resultados de ejecución ni archivos.","receipt_ref":"/datos/workspaces/personal/specorganon-validation/method-superiority-v1/native-reliability-02/attempt-02/transport/host-journal/role-06-study-author/receipt.json","source_files_sha256":"44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a","source_fingerprint":"b4f8af5943791707d6cec30b79aa5750260ef332576ee30265d0d05e52d88e8a","source_phase_snapshot":"d87e67fda61f74bc5f59a84847b7502c529366b7f5666f22bd36c0f428cfddff","usage_reported":{"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"cached_input_tokens":5120,"input_tokens":15376,"output_tokens":1222,"reasoning_output_tokens":219}},{"action":"review","actor":"reviewer:gemini-isolated-review","cost":null,"findings":[],"job_id":"role-07-study-review","phase":"study","reason":"La fase study cumple rigurosamente con los requisitos del contrato de fase y los criterios de revisión. Los artefactos lf_question, lf_hypothesis, lf_protocol y lf_indicator, respaldados documentalmente por lf_contract_evidence, establecen una investigación técnica verificable y falsable sin incurrir en circularidad ni extrapolar beneficios de campo. El protocolo define con claridad la unidad de observación, el método de contraste y la población sintética finita, señalando explícitamente sus límites e incertidumbre. El indicador contract_mismatches prespecifica su métrica y unidad ('lotes') sin adjudicar resultados empíricos previos ni ejecuciones no realizadas, distinguiendo con rigor entre datos documentales, inferencias y supuestos. Se respetan íntegramente las dependencias y los límites de recursos de la fase.","receipt_ref":"/datos/workspaces/personal/specorganon-validation/method-superiority-v1/native-reliability-02/attempt-02/transport/host-journal/role-07-study-review/receipt.json","source_files_sha256":"44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a","source_fingerprint":"62d1f7e5472eb09243a22e94057924b935400cfcb9efe98cc92f4fa78c52344e","source_phase_snapshot":"417b6bbddb8cc9759d0fc24e41cb4fd8e496f71f994be2d21fa69c588593ad80","usage_reported":{"cache_read_tokens":0,"input_tokens":23678,"output_tokens":1500,"thinking_tokens":1303,"to